+    /// 0181 (TF_DS_ENGRAM_ROWCACHE_FILTER): an approximate-membership front for `has()`, so a miss takes no lock.
+    /// A plain two-probe Bloom over the keys, bits set under the cache's own mutex at `put` and never cleared: a
+    /// stale bit after an eviction (or a collision) costs the old locked probe, and a key in the map always has its
+    /// bits - no false negatives - so every answer is still the map's own.
